## Notes: Advisor HUD + command channel for the shadow army (hello world stage)
## Version: 0.1.0

# Core UI first so a QuestData load failure cannot kill /sa / panel.
ShadowArmy.lua
# Optional pure-data files. Every addon read of these is guarded
# (`ShadowArmyQuestData and ...`), so a file that fails to load (size, parse,
# missing after a fresh checkout) only degrades the feature that uses it -
# the advisor panel and /sa keep working.
#   QuestData ~1.6MB : quest waypoints; absent -> checklist without waypoints
#   ItemData  ~1.1MB : item facts;      absent -> no vendor-price knowledge
#   RoadData  ~52KB  : road polylines;  absent -> straight-line routing
QuestData.lua
ItemData.lua
RoadData.lua
